OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786279672
OL,3,CIllegal tobacco, vapes and drugs
OL,4,Chidden in floors and secret shop
OL,5,Cshelves
OL,7,FSix convenience stores on the same
OL,8,Fhigh street have been closed, all in
OL,9,Fthe last five weeks, after they were
OL,10,Ffound to be selling illegal goods.
OL,12,FSome products were even sold to
OL,13,Fchildren under the age of 18.
OL,15,FThe stores on Cradley Heath High
OL,16,FStreet were all found to sell a
OL,17,Fcombination of illegal vapes, tobacco,
OL,18,Falcohol, and in some cases, drugs.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
