OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786279672
OL,3,CIllegal tobacco, vapes and drugs
OL,4,Chidden in floors and secret shop
OL,5,Cshelves
OL,7,FAn eight month long investigation was
OL,8,Fled by Trading Standards, and
OL,9,Fsupported by Sandwell Council and West
OL,10,FMidlands Police.
OL,12,FInvestigators received intel that
OL,13,Fthese shops may be selling illicit
OL,14,Fgoods. They then tested these products
OL,15,Fby purchasing them themselves. Once
OL,16,Finvestigators had enough evidence that
OL,17,Fthese goods were illegal, they
OL,18,Fapproached a local court and applied
OL,19,Ffor a closure order on the premises.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786279672
OL,3,CIllegal tobacco, vapes and drugs
OL,4,Chidden in floors and secret shop
OL,5,Cshelves
OL,7,FThe latest closure orders have been
OL,8,Fgranted to close International Vape
OL,9,Fand All Day for the maximum period of
OL,10,Fthree months.
OL,12,FITV News Central were able to see the
OL,13,Fhidden cupboards and underfloor
OL,14,Fcompartments where illicit goods were
OL,15,Ffound to be hidden in one of the
OL,16,Fstores.
OL,18,FThe leader of Sandwell Council. Ray
OL,19,FNock, says in some cases, at least one
OL,20,Fof the stores was selling illegal
OL,21,Fgoods to children under the age of 18.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786279672
OL,3,CIllegal tobacco, vapes and drugs
OL,4,Chidden in floors and secret shop
OL,5,Cshelves
OL,7,FHe said: "It's a simple high-volume,
OL,8,Fhigh-profit margin product and
OL,9,Fbasically it's all down to money."
OL,11,FSandwell Council is calling on
OL,12,Fstronger powers for local authorities
OL,13,Fand supports Government proposals to
OL,14,Fextend the maximum duration of closure
OL,15,Forders from three months to 12 months
OL,16,Funder the Antisocial Behaviour, Crime
OL,17,Fand Policing Act 2014.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786279672
OL,3,CIllegal tobacco, vapes and drugs
OL,4,Chidden in floors and secret shop
OL,5,Cshelves
OL,7,FIn June 2026, plans were put forward
OL,8,Fby the government to double the
OL,9,Fmaximum duration of closure orders in
OL,10,Forder to give investigators more time
OL,11,Fto gather evidence, pursue
OL,12,Fprosecutions and identify the criminal
OL,13,Fbosses directing activity from behind
OL,14,Fthe scenes.
OL,16,FThese new measures are under
OL,17,Fconsultation, with final plans
OL,18,Fexpected by the end of this year.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/5
